      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "\u0003Target audience",
      "pageStart": 18,
      "pageEnd": 18,
      "target": "../sections/sec-007-13-target-audience.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The guidelines are primarily intended for use by national HIV programme managers and policy-\nmakers. They will also be of interest to the following audiences:\n•\tnational HIV treatment and prevention advisory boards;\n•\tnational TB and HIV programme managers;\n•\tmanagers of maternal, newborn and child health programmes;\n•\tmanagers of sexual and reproductive health programmes;\n•\tclinicians and other health service providers;\n•\tmanagers of national laboratory services;\n•\tpeople living with HIV and key population networks and organizations\n•\tcommunity-led and community-based organizations and servic",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Lists the target audience of the guidelines, chiefly national HIV programme managers and policy-makers, as well as clinicians, laboratory managers, community organizations and funding agencies.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
