        "text": "Box 3 sets out implementation considerations for viral load monitoring in pregnant and breastfeeding women, such as prioritizing same-day point-of-care testing and adherence counselling at every antenatal and postnatal visit. It specifies when to test according to the timing of ART initiation and what to do, including enhanced infant prophylaxis and infant testing, when viral load exceeds 1000 copies/ml.",
