        "text": "Table A3 summarizes the methods of the systematic reviews behind each PICO question, including the dapivirine vaginal ring, point-of-care infant diagnosis and point-of-care viral load monitoring, with review leads, search dates and included studies. The text then describes how the virtual meeting was run, with a 60% voting threshold agreed but all recommendations reached by consensus. Evidence-to-decision tables were prepared in line with GRADE and discussed with a methodologist.",
